{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08008","headline":"飞龙引二首 二 · 李白","name":"飞龙引二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鼎湖流水清且闲，轩辕去时有弓劒。\n古人传道留其间，後宫婵娟多花颜。\n乘鸾飞烟亦不还，骑龙攀天造天关。\n造天关，闻天语，长云河车载玉女。\n载玉女，过紫皇，紫皇乃赐白兔所捣之药方，後天而老雕三光。\n下视瑶池见王母，蛾眉萧飒如秋霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}